    "title": "Mannic",
    "description": "Mannic is a practical tool that can convert English text into Morse code and reverse it. Whether you're learning Morse code or need to send encrypted messages in emergency situations, this app can help you quickly and accurately convert text into Morse code or convert Morse code into readable English text. Additionally, the app contains a large number of commonly used language abbreviations and their corresponding Morse codes, making it more convenient for you to use Morse code. Simple and easy to use.",
